  "narrative": "Conflict\n\nTurkish Military in Iraq & Syria\n\nIncident Code\n\nTS631\n\nIncident Code\n\nTS631\n\nIncident Date\n\n21 September 2023\n\nLocation\n\nقرية صفاوية, Safawiyah village, Raqqa, Syria\n\nSections\n\nAssessment\n\nKey Information\n\nVictims\n\nMilitary Statements\n\nMedia from Sources\n\nSources\n\nPermalink\n\nAirwars Assessment\n\nLast Updated: December 15, 2024\n\nA civilian was injured by alleged Turkish drone strikes on the village of Safawiyah on September 21, 2023.\n\nHawar News reported that a citizen named Qaban Aziz Al-Khalil (29 years old) was injured and transferred to Al-Raqqa Hospital to receive treatmentÂ when a Turkish drone bombed the village of Safawiyah.\n\nBasNews reported that a Turkish drone bombed a Syrian Democratic Forces (SDF) military point, resulting in casualties, including a civilian. The source specified that number of fighters were killed, including prominent officials.\n\nVictims\n\nInvidivuals\n\nQaban Aziz Al-Khalil قبن عزيز الخليل\n\n29 years old\nmale\ninjured\n\nKey Information\n\nCountry\n\nSyria\n\nMilitary Actor\n\nTurkish Military\n\nStrike Type\n\nAirstrike (Drone Strike)\n\nStrike Status\n\nLikely strike\n\nCivilian Harm Reported\n\nYes\n\nCivilian Harm Status\n\nFair\n\nReported by two or more credible sources, with likely or confirmed near actions by a belligerent.\n\nCauses of Death / Injury\n\nHeavy weapons and explosive munitions\n\nCivilians reported injured\n\n1\n\n1 Man\n\nMilitary Statements\n\nTurkish Military Assessment\n\nSuspected belligerent\n\nTurkish Military\n\nTurkish Military position on incident\n\nNot yet assessed\n\nMedia From Sources (1)\n\n← Prev\n\nNext →\n\nThis media contains graphic content. Click to unblur.\n\nGraphic\n\nSources (7)\n\nHawar News ↗\n\nFacebook Arabic\n\nArchive\n\nANF ↗\n\nArabic\n\nArchive\n\nSyrian Observatory for Human Rights ↗\n\nArabic\n\nArchive\n\nBasNews ↗\n\nArabic\n\nArchive\n\nMehran Atêş ↗\n\nFacebook Arabic\n\nArchive\n\nØ³ÙÙÙ\nان الطويل